Database Title: NEUROLINGUA: A Neuroimaging Database Tailored to Unraveling the Complexity of Multilingual Comprehension.

Paper Title: Unraveling the Complexity of Multilingual Comprehension: Neuroimaging and Linguistic Profiling in 700+ Individuals

Authors: Ileana Quiñones a,b,c*†, Amaia Carrión-Castillo a,c*†, Iñigo Diez-Zabala b†, Laura de Frutos-Sagastuy a,d, Brendan Costello a,c, David Carcedo a, Lucía Manso-Ortega a,d, Maksim Slivka e, Abraham Sánchez a,d, Anique Schüller a,d, César Caballero-Gaudes a,c, Pedro M. Paz-Alonso a,c, Manuel Carreiras a,c,d

Author Affiliation: 
