This version of the dataset does not include the smoothed files that are presented in Figure 1 of the paper: Quiñones, I., Carrión-Castillo, A., Díez, I., de Frutos-Sagastuy, L., Costello, B., Carcedo, D., ... & Carreiras, M. (2025). NEUROLINGUA: A Neuroimaging Database Tailored to Unravel the Complexity of Multilingual Comprehension. bioRxiv, 2025-06.
